   <item>
    <widget class="QTabWidget" name="denseTabs">
     <property name="currentIndex">
      <number>0</number>
     </property>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="sgbmTab">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>深度图 (SGBM)</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="sgbmTabLayout">
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="sgbmGroup">
         <property name="title">
          <string>SGBM 视差估计参数</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QFormLayout" name="sgbmForm">
          <item row="0" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="numDispLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>视差范围:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_numDispSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="0" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_numDispSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>视差搜索范围（像素，必须是16的倍数）。值越大可检测更大深度差，但运算更慢。
建议：128（标准）~256（大场景）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>16</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>512</number>
            </property>
            <property name="singleStep">
             <number>16</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>128</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="blockSizeLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>匹配块大小:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_blockSizeSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_blockSizeSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>立体匹配块大小（奇数，3~21）。越大越稳健但细节损失；纹理丰富时用小值。
建议：7~11</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>3</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>21</number>
            </property>
            <property name="singleStep">
             <number>2</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>9</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="uniquenessLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>唯一性比率:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_uniquenessSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_uniquenessSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>唯一性比率：最优视差得分比次优好多少才接受（0=关闭）。
值越高误匹配越少但覆盖率下降。建议：5~15</string>
            </property>
            <property name="suffix">
             <string> %</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>0</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>50</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>10</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="3" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="speckleSizeLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>噪斑消除窗口:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_speckleSizeSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="3" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_speckleSizeSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>噪斑消除窗口（像素数）。小于此尺寸的孤立视差区域将被过滤。
建议：50~200</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>0</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>1000</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>100</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="4" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_fullDpCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>使用 SGBM_3WAY 模式（更慢更精确）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="5" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_wlsFilterCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>启用 WLS 视差后过滤（平滑边缘，需要 opencv_ximgproc）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="6" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="depthRangeLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>有效深度范围:</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="6" column="1">
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="depthRangeLayout">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="minDepthLabel">
              <property name="text">
               <string>最小:</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="m_minDepthSpin">
              <property name="decimals">
               <number>3</number>
              </property>
              <property name="minimum">
               <double>0.001000000000000</double>
              </property>
              <property name="maximum">
               <double>9999.000000000000000</double>
              </property>
              <property name="value">
               <double>0.010000000000000</double>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="maxDepthLabel">
              <property name="text">
               <string>  最大:</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="m_maxDepthSpin">
              <property name="suffix">
               <string> (单位:与坐标系一致)</string>
              </property>
              <property name="decimals">
               <number>1</number>
              </property>
              <property name="minimum">
               <double>0.100000000000000</double>
              </property>
              <property name="maximum">
               <double>10000000.000000000000000</double>
              </property>
              <property name="value">
               <double>100000.000000000000000</double>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <spacer name="sgbmSpacer">
         <property name="orientation">
          <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
          <size>
           <width>20</width>
           <height>40</height>
          </size>
         </property>
        </spacer>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="cloudTab">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>点云</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="cloudTabLayout">
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="cloudGroup">
         <property name="title">
          <string>稠密点云参数</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QFormLayout" name="cloudForm">
          <item row="0" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="minConfLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>最低置信度:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_minConfSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="0" column="1">
           <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="m_minConfSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>WLS 滤波后的最低置信度阈值（0~1）。越高误差越少但点云越稀疏。建议：0.1~0.3</string>
            </property>
            <property name="decimals">
             <number>2</number>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <double>0.000000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <double>1.000000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="singleStep">
             <double>0.050000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <double>0.100000000000000</double>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_multiViewCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>多视图一致性融合（减少飞点，需要 ≥2 组深度图）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_colorsCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>从影像采样颜色（RGB 点云）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="3" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_normalsCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>估计点云法向量（Poisson 重建必须开启）</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="4" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="normalKnnLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>法向量 KNN 邻域:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_normalKnnSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="4" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_normalKnnSpin">
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>8</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>64</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>20</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <spacer name="cloudSpacer">
         <property name="orientation">
          <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
          <size>
           <width>20</width>
           <height>40</height>
          </size>
         </property>
        </spacer>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="meshTab">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>网格重建（可选）</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="meshTabLayout">
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="meshGroup">
         <property name="title">
          <string>（可选）网格重建</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QFormLayout" name="meshForm">
          <item row="0" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_buildMeshCheck">
            <property name="text">
             <string>同时重建三角网格模型</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="meshMethodLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>重建算法:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_meshMethodCombo</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="1" column="1">
           <widget class="QComboBox" name="m_meshMethodCombo">
            <item>
             <property name="text">
              <string>体素 TSDF + Marching Cubes（推荐）</string>
             </property>
            </item>
            <item>
             <property name="text">
              <string>Ball Pivoting（快速近似）</string>
             </property>
            </item>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="voxelResLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>体素分辨率:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_voxelResSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="2" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_voxelResSpin">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>体素格沿最长轴的分辨率。256=精度与速度平衡，512=高精度但内存开销大。</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>64</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>512</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>256</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="3" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="smoothIterLabel">
            <property name="text">
             <string>Laplacian 平滑迭代:</string>
            </property>
            <property name="buddy">
             <cstring>m_smoothIterSpin</cstring>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item row="3" column="1">
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="m_smoothIterSpin">
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>0</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>10</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>1</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <spacer name="meshSpacer">
         <property name="orientation">
          <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
          <size>
           <width>20</width>
           <height>40</height>
          </size>
         </property>
        </spacer>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
